	(descr "OPTIONAL reset button. Omron B3U-1000P 3.0 x 2.5 x 1.6 mm top-actuated SMD tact, no ground terminal. Lands per Omron recommended land pattern (KiCad Button_Switch_SMD:SW_SPST_B3U-1000P). Reversible: identical lands on both faces, tied by vias. Pad 1 = XIAO RST (Seeed pad 26), pad 2 = GND. Alt: any 2-pad 3x2.5 tact on 3.4 mm land centres.")
